            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 400\" role=\"img\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; max-width:460px; display:block; margin:0 auto;\" aria-label=\"Esfera que mostra o Equador em zero graus, com as latitudes medidas para o norte e para o sul\"><defs><radialGradient id=\"htLatGlobe\" cx=\"35%\" cy=\"30%\" r=\"75%\"><stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#eaf3fb\"/><stop offset=\"60%\" stop-color=\"#b9d5ec\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#7fa8c9\"/></radialGradient></defs><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"190\" r=\"145\" fill=\"url(#htLatGlobe)\" stroke=\"#2c5d8f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><ellipse cx=\"170\" cy=\"64.4\" rx=\"72.5\" ry=\"17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8fb8da\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><ellipse cx=\"170\" cy=\"117.5\" rx=\"125.6\" ry=\"29.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4a86bb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><ellipse cx=\"170\" cy=\"262.5\" rx=\"125.6\" ry=\"29.4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#4a86bb\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><ellipse cx=\"170\" cy=\"315.6\" rx=\"72.5\" ry=\"17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8fb8da\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><ellipse cx=\"170\" cy=\"190\" rx=\"145\" ry=\"34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"25\" y2=\"190\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"190\" x2=\"44.4\" y2=\"117.5\" stroke=\"#555\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><path d=\"M 65 190 A 105 105 0 0 1 79.1 137.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"190\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#333\"/><text x=\"57\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"17\" font-style=\"italic\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#333\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#f4f9fd\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">δ</text><text x=\"313\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"18\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#c0392b\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#f4f9fd\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">0°</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2f6fb3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#f4f9fd\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">Norte</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2f6fb3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#f4f9fd\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">0° → 90° N</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2f6fb3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#f4f9fd\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">Sul</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"272\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#2f6fb3\" paint-order=\"stroke\" stroke=\"#f4f9fd\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">0° → 90° S</text></svg><b>Figura 3</b>: Uma esfera que mostra as linhas imaginárias da latitude. O <b>Equador</b> é o paralelo de referência (0°). As latitudes são medidas a partir dele para o <b>norte</b> (0° a 90° N) e para o <b>sul</b> (0° a 90° S).</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
